    {
      "body": "The 液体 (liquid) material group drives ¥266.3M (69% of revenue). Top products 异戊二烯 (¥88.5M), 戊烷发泡剂 (¥77.3M) and 抽余碳五 (¥68.4M) concentrate ~60% of sales.",
